# DUNE EXPRESS: a punch stuns (a stunned guard starts to patrol, and his stun
# only counts down in the lawmen's time); a plank wall takes three punches,
# cracking as it goes, and three ducking punches take the floor out from
# under you.
game dune
wait 5
cheat mission 1
cheat pos 15 6
cheat face 0
press B
expect law0_stun > 170
expect law0_state == 1
wait 2
expect phase == 1
wait 100
expect law0_stun > 170
cheat mission 1
cheat clear_law
cheat pos 12 6
cheat face 0
expect tile115 == 2
press B
expect tile115 == 2
press B
expect tile115 == 2
press B
expect tile115 == 0
cheat mission 1
cheat clear_law
cheat pos 16 6
hold DOWN
press B
press B
expect tile167 == 3
press B
wait 40
release DOWN
expect tile167 == 0
expect alive == 0
expect why == 2
